This is sample code for evaluation and experimentation, not for production use.
It does not include any third-party model, simulator or dataset. The deploy scripts
download the components below at RUNTIME on your own EC2 instance; nothing listed here
is vendored in this repository. Each component is governed by its own license. You are responsible for reviewing and
complying with the license and terms of use of every model, checkpoint, dataset and
tool you choose to download and run, including any non-commercial restrictions.

Licenses below were checked on 2026-10-22 against the upstream GitHub repository
license file and the Hugging Face model card. "unspecified" means the source states
no license; treat such components as research/evaluation only until the owner says
otherwise.

